# Citation metadata for Awesome MLSecOps.
# Format: Citation File Format 1.2.0 (https://citation-file-format.github.io/).
# GitHub renders this file as a "Cite this repository" button and exposes
# APA and BibTeX entries. Zenodo, Zotero, and other reference managers
# read it directly, and AI search engines use it to attribute this catalog.

cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use or reference this catalog in research, documentation, tooling,
  or teaching material, please cite it using the metadata below.
type: dataset
title: "Awesome MLSecOps: Machine Learning and AI Security Resources"
abstract: >-
  A curated, community-maintained catalog of MLSecOps (Machine Learning
  Security Operations) resources: open-source and commercial AI security
  tools, adversarial machine learning research repositories, LLM and AI
  agent security tools, data privacy and anonymization tools, threat
  modeling frameworks, attack vector references, MLOps infrastructure
  vulnerabilities, learning resources, and books. MLSecOps is the practice
  of integrating security throughout the machine learning lifecycle, from
  data collection and model development to deployment, monitoring, and
  incident response.
authors:
